    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n- Observe the sample webpage with named sections (Header, Main Content, Footer).\r\n- Review the separate HTML, CSS, and JavaScript code sections below the sample page.\r\n- Click the 'Find Header Code' button and see the relevant code lines highlight.\r\n- Click the 'Find Main Code' button and see its code lines highlight.\r\n- Click the 'Find Footer Code' button and see its code lines highlight.\r\n- Understand how code for structure, style, and behavior is found for each section.",
